
% Breakaway

a: vi V | I IV |
a_cad: vi V | IV |
aa: $a $a_cad
link: $a $a_cad
In: $aa*2
Vr: $aa*2
a_turnaround: vi V | II | IV V |
b: I | V | vi | IV |
bb: $b $a_cad
Ch: $bb*2
c: V | I IV |
c_turnaround: II | IV V |
bridge: $c*3 $c_turnaround
ending: $a_cad*3
S: [C] $In $Vr*2 $a_turnaround $Ch $link $Vr $a_turnaround $Ch $bridge $Ch $ending
